[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10200.469, "timestamp": "02:50:00", "text": "すでにみんな混乱している"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10201.79, "timestamp": "02:50:01", "text": "私のせい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10205.03, "timestamp": "02:50:05", "text": "声と彼らは混乱して言う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10208.79, "timestamp": "02:50:08", "text": "私の声の彼らは、彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10212.79, "timestamp": "02:50:12", "text": "自分の性別について、何もかも混乱している。いいえ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10215.11, "timestamp": "02:50:15", "text": "でも、それは一つのことですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10218.15, "timestamp": "02:50:18", "text": "次に、モデル電流の出現"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10221.83, "timestamp": "02:50:21", "text": "このモデル、現在のもの、私は知らない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10223.91, "timestamp": "02:50:23", "text": "混乱を招いているかどうかは別として"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10226.63, "timestamp": "02:50:26", "text": "これは男性モデルですが、未来のモデル"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10228.75, "timestamp": "02:50:28", "text": "あまりにも。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10232.389, "timestamp": "02:50:32", "text": "いいえ。ええと、未来のモデルも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10235.87, "timestamp": "02:50:35", "text": "さらに混乱を招くでしょう。いいえ、しかし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10239.83, "timestamp": "02:50:39", "text": "えっと、考えてみたんだけど、もしかしたら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10242.469, "timestamp": "02:50:42", "text": "私の話し方とか、全部。それから私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10242.598, "timestamp": "02:50:42", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u wanted to upload reels to increase reach, but then u 're uploading them all at the same time wont do much"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10246.309, "timestamp": "02:50:46", "text": "なぜそれが多すぎるのか考えた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10256.67, "timestamp": "02:50:56", "text": "えっと、なんて言うんでしたっけ？"}]